REMARK 400   2HHB. REFINED BY THE METHOD OF JACK AND LEVITT.  THIS              
REMARK 400         ENTRY PRESENTS THE BEST ESTIMATE OF THE                      
REMARK 400         COORDINATES.                                                 
REMARK 400   3HHB. SYMMETRY AVERAGED ABOUT THE (NON-CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC)           
