REMARK 400         ENERGY REFINEMENT METHOD OF LEVITT.  THIS ENTRY              
REMARK 400         PRESENTS COORDINATES THAT ARE ADEQUATE FOR MOST              
REMARK 400         PURPOSES, SUCH AS COMPARISON WITH OTHER STRUCTURES.          
